[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5161.11, "timestamp": "01:26:01", "text": "即将断开连接。所以如果我点击我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5162.629, "timestamp": "01:26:02", "text": "文本框，我不需要它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5164.149, "timestamp": "01:26:04", "text": "连接到启动图标"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5166.55, "timestamp": "01:26:06", "text": "不再拥有房产。还。现在是第三个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5169.669, "timestamp": "01:26:09", "text": "类型为实例交换。好的，我想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5171.59, "timestamp": "01:26:11", "text": "记住这一点。我们来看看这是什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5173.27, "timestamp": "01:26:13", "text": "会帮助我们完成这件事。如果我选择"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5175.03, "timestamp": "01:26:15", "text": "假设我想创建一个按钮实例"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5176.55, "timestamp": "01:26:16", "text": "更改此心形图标。所以，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5178.07, "timestamp": "01:26:18", "text": "你还记得我们之前是怎么做的吗？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5180.39, "timestamp": "01:26:20", "text": "必须双击才能选中"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5181.91, "timestamp": "01:26:21", "text": "例如这里。你看，即使现在，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5183.75, "timestamp": "01:26:23", "text": "挣扎中。我点击次数太多了。所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5185.27, "timestamp": "01:26:25", "text": "在图层面板中也可以看到，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5187.51, "timestamp": "01:26:27", "text": "选择心脏实例。然后我将"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5189.43, "timestamp": "01:26:29", "text": "进入设计面板并进行更改"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5191.83, "timestamp": "01:26:31", "text": "变成别的东西。现在，什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5193.99, "timestamp": "01:26:33", "text": "实例交换组件属性的作用是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5196.709, "timestamp": "01:26:36", "text": "它几乎将它提升到了最高水平。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5198.39, "timestamp": "01:26:38", "text": "就像我们处理文本一样。所以如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5201.83, "timestamp": "01:26:41", "text": "我选择最上方的心形图标。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5203.51, "timestamp": "01:26:43", "text": "在设计面板中显示"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5206.31, "tim